  "limitations": [
    "The deployment is a plain CREATE from the recorded deployer at nonce 7, which reproduces the router address. keccak256 of the deployment transaction input equals the manifest initcodeHash, and the constructor arguments decode to canonical Permit2, the reviewed v3 factory, wrapped native and position manager, the v4 PoolManager the router reports, and the production Across SpokePool. The router source was not compiled.",
    "Commands.sol at universal-router 802fe4c is byte-identical to the 999d561 copy the command codec follows.",
    "The orphaned v2.1.1 router 0x8876789976dEcBfCbBbe364623C63652db8C0904 is deliberately not pinned.",
    "The public RPC serves no historical state, so the runtime pin was taken and is rechecked at the latest block.",
    "Permit2 is an exact runtime pin of the canonical predeploy; its runtime differs from Arc's because Permit2 caches its chain-specific EIP-712 domain separator."
  ]
